Third-party code and assets bundled in this repository are NOT covered by the
MIT license above and retain the terms of their original sources:

- Three.js code under `vendor/three/` is distributed under its original MIT
  License, including the copyright and permission notice retained in
  `vendor/three/LICENSE`.
- Earth textures in `assets/earth/` come from the three.js project's example
  assets (https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js — MIT License) and are derived
  from NASA Visible Earth "Blue Marble" imagery
  (https://visibleearth.nasa.gov/collection/1484/planet-textures). NASA imagery
  is generally free of copyright; acknowledgement is appreciated.
- Planet models in `assets/planet-models/` are adapted for web delivery from
  NASA Visualization Technology Applications and Development (VTAD) models
  published in NASA Science's 3D Resources collection
  (https://science.nasa.gov/3d-resources/). Geometry and imagery remain
  credited to NASA and the mission teams identified on each source page.
